# Licensing

The `argvus-fonts` package bundles third-party fonts, each under its own
license:

## Terminus Font (OFL-1.1)

TerminusTTF.ttf is Copyright (c) 2006-2020 by Dimitar Toshkov Zhekov,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

## IBM Plex Mono (OFL-1.1)

IBM Plex Mono is Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp.,
licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
See `usr/share/fonts/IBM Plex Mono/OFL.txt` for the full license text.

## Font Awesome 7 Free (CC-BY-4.0)

Font Awesome Free is Copyright (c) Fonticons, Inc. (https://fontawesome.com),
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license.
Icons are CC BY 4.0; the font files are also made available under the
Font Awesome Free License which permits free commercial and personal use.

The full OFL-1.1 text is available at:

  https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/

The full CC-BY-4.0 text is available at:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode